    "projects": [
      {
        "id": "under-the-gaze",
        "title": "Under the Gaze",
        "kind": "Tarot project",
        "meta": [
          [
            "Media",
            "Digital illustration"
          ],
          [
            "Date",
            "2025–2026"
          ]
        ],
        "text": "This book functions as a form of remembrance, carrying shared memories between my sister and me, along with layers of symbolism embedded within the images. Rather than presenting the subject in a heavy or overwhelming way, I chose to focus on visual expression, allowing the emotions to exist in a quieter, more restrained manner—moving toward a sense of healing and positivity.\nBy constructing my own imagined world, these memories are reassembled and transformed into a subtle yet persistent presence. It feels as if she has entered my inner world, continuing to exist in a different form.",
