      {
        "id": "a-kind-of-reality",
        "title": "A Kind of Reality",
        "kind": "Book project",
        "meta": [
          [
            "Date",
            "April 2025"
          ],
          [
            "Place",
            "New York"
          ]
        ],
        "text": "\"A Kind of Reality\" Illustration Series | Visual Reinterpretation of Yu Hua's Novel\nThis is a parable about violence, cycles, and indifference.\nBased on Yu Hua's novel A Kind of Reality, I've reconstructed this bone-chilling family tragedy through illustrations—from the oppressive silence at the breakfast table, to a child's ignorant cruelty, and finally to the meticulously calculated revenge of the adult world.",
