        "text": "\"The Circus\" Series Illustrations | A Black Fairy Tale of Role Reversal\nWhen the spectator in the cage becomes the spectacle—\nThis series depicts the alienation of a little girl in an animal-ruled circus: from a terrified awakening, to being forced to learn \"animal etiquette,\" until she finally becomes part of the grotesque performance. Through this absurd role reversal, we might come to realize: When humans force animals to perform, who is really taming whom?",
