        "id": "stacked-realms-teapot",
        "title": "Stacked Realms Teapot",
        "text": "This is a ceramic work that combines Chinese sculpture art and personal elements. The shape of the teapot is stacked with classic Chinese cultural symbols such as Buddha and dragon, forming a unique visual narrative. The work not only shows the weight of Chinese sculptural art, but also incorporates contemporary personal expression - a cat with big eyes on the body of the pot (a nod to my mentor's style) and my self-portrait, where tradition and the individual, history and the contemporary meet on the same object. The work is both a tribute to the tradition of Eastern sculpture and an experiment in exploring the connection between self-identity and culture.",
